# Releases deploy with `vercel build` + `vercel deploy --prebuilt`, which uploads only .vercel/output.
# These lines guard against a plain `vercel deploy` uploading the source: never send secrets or the
# Android project to Vercel. The secret patterns match .gitignore's.
.env*
android/
*.jks
*.keystore
*.pem
*.p12
google-services.json
keystore.properties
.superpowers/
